    "machine_start_gcode":  "{if gcode_flavor == \"klipper\"}\nSTART_PRINTING\n{endif}\n\nG90\nM83\nG28\n\n; 如果设备支持热仓且有设定热仓温度，先启动热仓加温，但不等待\n{if support_chamber_temp_control and overall_chamber_temperature > 0}\nM141 S{overall_chamber_temperature}\n{endif}\n\n; 先等热床到目标温度 -5\nM190 S{max(0, first_layer_bed_temperature[initial_extruder]-5)}\n\n; 先预热所有会用到的喷头\n{if is_extruder_used[0]}\nM104 T0 S{first_layer_temperature[0]+standby_temperature_delta}\n{endif}\n{if is_extruder_used[1]}\nM104 T1 S{first_layer_temperature[1]+standby_temperature_delta}\n{endif}\n\n; 等热床到最终目标温度\nM190 S{first_layer_bed_temperature[initial_extruder]}\n\n; 如果设备支持热仓且有设定热仓温度，等待热仓到最终目标温度\n{if support_chamber_temp_control and overall_chamber_temperature > 0}\nM191 S{overall_chamber_temperature}\n{endif}\n\n; ===== 清洁非初始喷嘴 T0，左侧清洁 =====\n{if is_extruder_used[0] and initial_extruder != 0}\nT0\nM109 T0 S{first_layer_temperature[0]}\nG92 E0\nG1 X{print_bed_min[0]} Y{print_bed_min[1]-0.5} F{travel_speed*60}\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F300\nG1 E10 F300\nG1 X{print_bed_min[0]+48} E10 F900\nG1 X{print_bed_min[0]+50} Z0 F600\nG1 E-{retract_length_toolchange[0]} F{filament_retraction_speed[0]*60}\nM104 T0 S{first_layer_temperature[0]+standby_temperature_delta}\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F600\nG1 F{travel_speed*60}\n{endif}\n\n; ===== 清洁非初始喷嘴 T1，右侧清洁 =====\n{if is_extruder_used[1] and initial_extruder != 1}\nT1\nM109 T1 S{first_layer_temperature[1]}\nG92 E0\nG1 X{print_bed_max[0]} Y{print_bed_min[1]-0.5} F{travel_speed*60}\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F300\nG1 E10 F300\nG1 X{print_bed_max[0]-48} E10 F900\nG1 X{print_bed_max[0]-50} Z0 F600\nG1 E-{retract_length_toolchange[1]} F{filament_retraction_speed[1]*60}\nM104 T1 S{first_layer_temperature[1]+standby_temperature_delta}\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F600\nG1 F{travel_speed*60}\n{endif}\n\n; ===== 清洁初始喷嘴 T0，左侧清洁 =====\n{if initial_extruder == 0}\nT0\nM109 T0 S{first_layer_temperature[0]}\nG92 E0\nG1 X{print_bed_min[0]} Y{print_bed_min[1]-0.5} F{travel_speed*60}\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F300\nG1 E10 F300\nG1 X{print_bed_min[0]+48} E10 F900\nG1 X{print_bed_min[0]+50} Z0 F600\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F600\nG1 F{travel_speed*60}\n{endif}\n\n; ===== 清洁初始喷嘴 T1，右侧清洁 =====\n{if initial_extruder == 1}\nT1\nM109 T1 S{first_layer_temperature[1]}\nG92 E0\nG1 X{print_bed_max[0]} Y{print_bed_min[1]-0.5} F{travel_speed*60}\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F300\nG1 E10 F300\nG1 X{print_bed_max[0]-48} E10 F900\nG1 X{print_bed_max[0]-50} Z0 F600\nG1 Z{first_layer_height} F300\nG1 F{travel_speed*60}\n{endif}\n",
